<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's reserves rise to $8.4 bln in May.</title>
<headline>Hungary's reserves rise to $8.4 bln in May.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's international reserves rose to $8.4 billion in May from $7.9 billion in April according to preliminary figures from the National Bank of Hungary on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
